Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She jumped off the bridge!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.07,0:02:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NDon't follow her!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.33,0:02:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NPaulie.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.69,0:02:21.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NYou running down there isn't gonna do her\Na lick of good.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.26,0:02:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NBut...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.26,0:02:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know how dangerous it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.63,0:02:26.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll drown, just like her.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.56,0:02:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it gets bad, I'll\Nhandle things, myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.38,0:02:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have the guts to do that.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.18,0:02:32.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's either brave or stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.78,0:02:35.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, this is definitely stupid!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.22,0:02:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.89,0:02:36.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.78,0:02:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.48,0:02:39.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sea's gonna swallow you up!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.72,0:02:41.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NA sea anemone.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.02,0:02:47.27,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,A sea anemone?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.72,0:02:51.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is a sea anemone coming out of a\Nchimney?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.13,0:02:55.26,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.61,0:03:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.31,0:03:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not the reindeer, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:18.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you're up\Nagainst. We'll help you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.50,0:03:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NYou're awesome, Pirate Lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool, girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.73,0:03:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't make it back in time!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.14,0:03:27.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can see for yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.78,0:03:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wave's gonna\Nhit any second now!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.39,0:03:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NOh man!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.29,0:03:35.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no turning back now!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.73,0:03:38.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're as good as dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.61,0:03:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.75,0:03:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.75,0:03:44.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.42,0:03:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NChopper?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.40,0:03:55.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't go any further.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.36,0:04:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.26,0:04:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell are\Nyou doing up there?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.14,0:04:18.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NNami?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.37,0:04:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.37,0:04:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.71,0:04:25.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, listen, listen,\Nit's not my fault.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That pigeon guy sent me\Nflying and I got stuck
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.47,0:04:30.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,between these buildings,\Nso I can't move.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:30.85,0:04:32.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm trying, though!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.77,0:04:45.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this a joke to you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.30,0:04:47.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.10,0:04:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those guys from the\Ngovernment took Robin away
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.67,0:04:52.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you weren't\Neven there to help!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.08,0:04:58.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She did it all for us, you know!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:58.78,0:05:01.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's going to\Nsacrifice herself!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.04,0:05:13.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government was\Nplanning on attacking us,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.58,0:05:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but Robin turned herself over\Nto CP9 so we would be safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.08,0:05:19.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no place\Nleft in this world
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.69,0:05:21.86,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,for me to go, or return to.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.89,0:05:23.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.22,0:05:26.12,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the last time you'll ever see me.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.96,0:05:31.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NShe knew they would kill\Nher but she didn't care!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.37,0:05:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThen Robin was\Nlying this whole time?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.61,0:05:49.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.46,0:05:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.38,0:05:57.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let Robin die!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.37,0:05:59.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NCheck out the size of that thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.84,0:06:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh man!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.77,0:06:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The waves've never\Nbeen that big before!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.41,0:06:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey this is really bad, guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.68,0:06:07.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run away, pirate lady!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.11,0:06:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta get out of there!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:08.72,0:06:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You too, reindeer!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.47,0:06:15.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NYou're gonna tear me in half!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.44,0:06:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NYou're really stuck!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.14,0:06:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How'd you get in\Nthere in the first place?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.21,0:06:21.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.69,0:06:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.16,0:06:33.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That wave's gonna hit any second now!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.16,0:06:36.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHow the hell should I know?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.28,0:06:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah Hold on that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.39,0:06:39.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Chopper.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.45,0:06:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you carrying the Kintentsu?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.19,0:06:41.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.72,0:06:42.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your sword?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.97,0:06:44.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have one of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.57,0:06:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How on earth did you know that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.80,0:06:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I can tell with that\None at least since it's cursed.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.77,0:06:52.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, thanks for carrying it for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.84,0:06:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here, quick.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.61,0:06:55.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put it in my hand.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.38,0:06:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:57.28,0:07:01.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get to higher ground! Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.12,0:07:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NIt's all over, they're\Nnot gonna make it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.06,0:07:05.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll get swept away for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is here!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.27,0:07:27.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.74,0:07:36.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.67,0:08:02.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That guy's\Nout of control!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.67,0:08:04.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's knocking over buildings!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.17,0:08:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NStay back, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.55,0:08:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One-Sword Style!\NThirty-Six Caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.31,0:08:32.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NThis is bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're wrecking the town!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.43,0:08:36.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.17,0:08:37.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.07,0:08:43.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.37,0:08:44.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[CHOPPER]\NRumble!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.34,0:08:46.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Jumping Point!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.76,0:08:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just hold on to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.34,0:08:56.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NThey're washing away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:01.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NDamn it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.02,0:09:13.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NHey look!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.56,0:09:19.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They made it, I think!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.47,0:09:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.44,0:09:40.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They should be\Nsafe on the bridge.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's a big wave,\Nbut it's not that big!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.88,0:09:44.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys're amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta teach me that one!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.17,0:10:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the tidal\Nwave's still coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.20,0:10:06.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did Straw Hat make it?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.47,0:10:15.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know, man,\Nall I can see is water!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.11,0:10:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! Over there!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:20.14,0:10:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Paulie!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:50.25,0:10:51.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not safe yet!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.84,0:10:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run to shipbuilding island!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.80,0:10:57.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.94,0:10:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bridge is done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.17,0:11:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've never seen\Nanything like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.27,0:11:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The waves have never made it this far\Nbefore!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.42,0:11:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought we'd be safe here!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.22,0:11:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.82,0:11:40.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The tide's ebbing again.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.12,0:11:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.16,0:11:42.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.88,0:11:44.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's gonna be\Nanother wave like that
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.08,0:11:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and another after that one!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.90,0:11:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we wanna live, we gotta get
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.21,0:11:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to higher ground\Nlike everyone else.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.52,0:12:01.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NYou morons.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.87,0:12:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're lucky you're alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.10,0:12:03.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.97,0:12:06.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saved us, Rope Guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.88,0:12:09.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NI didn't know Aqua Laguna\Nwould be like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.04,0:12:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stop shaking!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.50,0:12:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it was that bad every year,\Nwe'd be sunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.27,0:12:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just as surprised as you folks are.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.54,0:12:20.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ain't normal at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.36,0:12:23.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NYou pirates are one\Nstep shy of crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.36,0:12:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're lucky to be alive right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.37,0:12:25.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOh!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.85,0:12:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Monster Granny!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.52,0:12:29.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were here too!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.95,0:12:31.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.45,0:12:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I may be drunk,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.69,0:12:35.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I'd have to be stupid to\Nstay at sea during this storm!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.60,0:12:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NYou were awesome, Mister Pirate!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.57,0:12:41.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your arms were\Nlike "boing!" "boing!"
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.64,0:12:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.21,0:12:48.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.18,0:12:52.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Little turd put my\Nface in a death grip
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.28,0:12:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then passed out like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.53,0:12:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey, Zoro what were\Nyou doing down there
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.27,0:13:00.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when the wave hit?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.24,0:13:01.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you get away?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.64,0:13:03.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.14,0:13:04.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.14,0:13:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro got stuck in a chimney.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.52,0:13:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got stuck in a chimney?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.40,0:13:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you dope!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.59,0:13:18.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't be that lame if I tried!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.49,0:13:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, you did\Nthe same thing... twice!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.23,0:13:23.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're both dopes, okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.23,0:13:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait where's Sanji\Nand U... Where's Sanji?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.17,0:13:31.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, there's a lot of\Nstuff I need to tell you.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.24,0:13:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You too, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHm?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.13,0:13:42.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Things are certainly\Nlooking up for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.01,0:13:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SPANDAM]\NAokiji is a generous man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Putting all those officers\Nand all those battleships
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.67,0:13:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at the tip of my fingers.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.07,0:13:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not that I haven't earned it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.17,0:13:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Under my fine leadership,
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.38,0:13:59.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP9 has certainly accomplished\Nsome excellent results.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.52,0:14:04.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now aren't you happy\Nfor your master, Funkfreed?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.36,0:14:06.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But no accolade is too great
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.03,0:14:08.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for the team who\Ncaptured Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.23,0:14:09.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's been a stain on the pride
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.66,0:14:12.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of the government\Nfor 20 years now.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.17,0:14:14.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And speaking of\Nstains, now that I know
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.17,0:14:16.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that detestable\NCutty Flam is still alive,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.72,0:14:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can have the satisfaction\Nof making him suffer.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.06,0:14:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only two people\Nin this wide world
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.19,0:14:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,have the means\Nof reviving Pluton
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.69,0:14:27.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and both of have been\Nnicely gathered together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:28.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And let me tell you,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.30,0:14:31.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Funkfreed that train can't\Nget here quick enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.27,0:14:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Soon, I'll have enough power
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.30,0:14:37.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to bring the whole\Nworld to its knees!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.71,0:14:48.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOnly one thing to do.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.27,0:14:51.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We set off and rescue them right away!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.80,0:14:54.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI had a feeling you'd say that.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.42,0:15:01.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, help us out, Rope Guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.13,0:15:04.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need a boat.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.03,0:15:05.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, we need a sea train.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.80,0:15:07.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you have another one of those?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.64,0:15:09.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is no "other" sea train.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.77,0:15:12.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Puffing Tom is one of a kind.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The man who made that train's a legend.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.51,0:15:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's miracle it\Ngot finished at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:16.78,0:15:20.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, sorry, I can't pull another\NSea Train out of my ass.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.44,0:15:22.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then lend us a ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.32,0:15:24.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The strongest and fastest\None you guys've got!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:25.04,0:15:27.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NDamn it, would you\Ngive it a rest already?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.88,0:15:29.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you stupid?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.06,0:15:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You saw what just happened!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.06,0:15:32.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You barely survived\Nthat wave on land
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.97,0:15:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you wanna go out to sea?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.80,0:15:36.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NI don't care how\Ngood the ship is...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.54,0:15:37.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't last five minutes!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.74,0:15:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.44,0:15:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NEven during a normal Aqua Laguna
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.81,0:15:43.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,no ship has ever made\Nit through the storm.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.41,0:15:45.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And this year, it's anything but normal.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.48,0:15:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just look at what happened\Nto the backstreets.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.47,0:15:52.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the first time the waves have ever\Ndone damage like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.57,0:15:54.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven was built to last.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.61,0:15:57.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it starts shaking, then we damn well\Nbetter listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.44,0:15:59.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you,\Neven if you went out there
Dialogue: 50,0:15:59.32,0:16:02.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in our biggest galleon,\Nyou'd be smashed to smithereens.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.45,0:16:04.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let\Nyou sail out there
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.72,0:16:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if I know you won't\Nmake it back alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.35,0:16:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait 'til morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.36,0:16:13.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll lend you a ship as soon as the storm\Npasses.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.43,0:16:15.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rest of you head to the evacuation\Nshelter.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're done searching for missing people.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:18.75,0:16:21.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.28,0:16:24.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we wait until\Nafter the storm settles
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.42,0:16:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we won't make it in time\Nto save Robin, will we?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.82,0:16:32.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard about Enies Lobby long before we\Ncame here.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:32.49,0:16:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you said it was\Na government island,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.26,0:16:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it made me remember something.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.83,0:16:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not just a base.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.06,0:16:40.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's also where the Gates of Justice are\Nlocated, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.33,0:16:43.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NGates of Justice?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.03,0:16:46.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby is known\Nas a "Judicial island."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.10,0:16:47.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that's all a lie.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.33,0:16:50.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The court they have there is only for\Nshow.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.47,0:16:52.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The truth is, if\Nyou've been taken there,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.47,0:16:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then you're already\Nconsidered guilty.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.21,0:16:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you arrive the\Ngovernment walks you
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.31,0:16:59.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,through an empty courtroom,\Nleading to a pair of
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.57,0:17:04.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,cold, steel doors that\Ntower above the entire island.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.88,0:17:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those doors are known as the Gates of\NJustice.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.28,0:17:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The criminals who\Nwalk through them
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.48,0:17:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,must abandon all hope.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.28,0:17:13.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once they reach the other side,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.55,0:17:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they'll never see the\Nlight of day again.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:16.22,0:17:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once you set sail\Nbeyond those doors,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.99,0:17:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there are only two\Ndestinations you can reach.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.26,0:17:23.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neither of which you\Nare ever likely to leave.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.57,0:17:26.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One is Navy Headquarters
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,where the strongest\Nmilitary powers
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.98,0:17:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the world gather\Nin the name of justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.65,0:17:34.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The other is Impel Down\Nan underwater prison,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.88,0:17:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,filled with torture chambers\Nand execution blocks.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.19,0:17:40.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how\Nvicious they may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the criminals imprisoned\Nthere can only wait for death.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.23,0:17:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words\Ngoing to Enies Lobby
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.93,0:17:49.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is no different than\Na death sentence.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.33,0:17:53.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no trial, no justice\Nand no hope of escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.20,0:17:54.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NRobin has a bounty on her head.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.15,0:18:01.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter where they take her,\Nshe'll face death, or worse.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:01.12,0:18:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every second we\Nsit here talking,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.52,0:18:05.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,she gets one step closer\Nto the Gates of Justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.49,0:18:08.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare tell us to wait until\Ntomorrow!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.10,0:18:12.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PAULIE]\NIf you know that much already,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.70,0:18:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've only got one thing to say.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.90,0:18:17.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if the sea was\Ncalm and you were able
Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.34,0:18:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to set sail that's the last\Nplace you should ever go.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.08,0:18:22.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, you people are
Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.34,0:18:25.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,wanted criminals just\Nthe same as your friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.36,0:18:27.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like you said,\NEnies Lobby is the front door
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.72,0:18:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to the World Government's\Nown personal playground.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.39,0:18:31.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've drawn battle lines
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.53,0:18:34.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,around that place that\Nshould never ever be crossed.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.66,0:18:37.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Regardless of how they\Nfeel about their crewmates,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.53,0:18:38.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,no pirate would be stupid enough
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.90,0:18:41.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to launch a\Nrescue mission there.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.26,0:18:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They know what would happen.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.31,0:18:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Picking a fight in that place
Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.94,0:18:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,is like declaring war\Non the entire Navy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.45,0:18:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NHey. I know how you must\Nfeel, but Paulie's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.89,0:18:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't leave during\NAqua Laguna, anyway!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.56,0:18:58.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be dead before you even get there!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.99,0:19:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no point in throwing your lives\Naway over this!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.39,0:19:05.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.09,0:19:06.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NFine then.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.60,0:19:08.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll steal a ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.96,0:19:12.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our crewmate is counting on us!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't try to get in our way!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.53,0:19:20.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're leaving now!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.00,0:19:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHIMNEY]\NWhoa, even the waves got mad!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.62,0:19:31.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WORKMAN]\NWhoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.32,0:19:32.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he gonna fight us?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:32.52,0:19:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sure was scary!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:35.49,0:19:36.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.50,0:19:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want a fight, you got it.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.89,0:19:46.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NAll of you.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.98,0:19:48.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.63,0:19:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NKokoro?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.01,0:19:54.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop bein' such a\Ndamn fool, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.78,0:19:58.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like it or not, Paulie's right on this\None.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.81,0:20:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up granny,\Nit's none of your business!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.38,0:20:03.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure about that, boy?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.01,0:20:06.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Either way, these\Nfolks are just trying
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.09,0:20:08.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to stop you from\Nkilling yourself.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.82,0:20:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The point is no\Nmatter how mad you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.75,0:20:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,no ship can handle Aqua Laguna.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.78,0:20:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Only a sea train made by a legendary man\Nstands a chance.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.72,0:20:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that, but\NI don't have any choice,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.72,0:20:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since the only sea train in the\Nworld has left town already!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.75,0:20:28.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're prepared to die, then that's\Nfine.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just come along with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.47,0:20:33.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll brave the storm on my sea train.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.89,0:21:00.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIAL]\NYou idiots!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.59,0:21:01.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.82,0:21:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he's not wearing a uniform,\Nthen he must be an intruder!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.50,0:21:11.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.46,0:21:15.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OFFICIALS]\NI guess playing innocent doesn't work in\Nhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.48,0:21:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And here I thought I could get out of a\Nfight.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.42,0:21:29.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh well, it's not my funeral.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.65,0:21:34.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSanji?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.52,0:21:36.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOSSES]\N– Hold it!\N– Hold it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.33,0:21:42.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think we're gonna let you get away\Nwith that?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.63,0:21:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're {\i1}smart.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.61,0:21:56.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}[SANJI]\NCollier Frite!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.39,0:22:04.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, you didn't\Nhijack the Sea Train
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.69,0:22:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,just to rescue {\i1}me,{\i0} did you?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.26,0:22:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what you're doing here.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.10,0:22:17.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Also, what's your name again,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.50,0:22:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't believe we've actually met before,\Nhave we?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.07,0:22:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.41,0:22:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You jerk.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.45,0:22:26.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bingo!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.15,0:22:28.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Transponder snails!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:29.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm, okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.35,0:22:32.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This must be a communications\Nroom or something.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.22,0:22:35.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucky I ran into this place so soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.58,0:22:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those guys I beat\Nup in the last cart
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.12,0:22:38.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,only had a bunch\Nof useless crap.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.66,0:22:40.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Masks and\Ncostumes and stuff.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.59,0:22:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, now that I have this\NI can get in touch with Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.09,0:22:44.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NLet me guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.88,0:22:47.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's one of your pirate friends,\Nisn't he?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.21,0:22:48.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[SANJI and USOPP]\N– EX friend.\N– EX friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.38,0:22:50.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The question is, who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.35,0:22:52.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the face of Water Seven's underworld.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.12,0:22:55.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ship dismantler, Franky.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.17,0:22:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're the bastard who beat up Usopp,\Nhuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.72,0:23:00.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He may be dead to me now,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.66,0:23:03.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he was part of\Nour crew, back then!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.22,0:23:05.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NHow many pieces you\Nwant me to cut you into?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.67,0:23:07.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NNo, no, no, wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.40,0:23:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like that now, a lot\Nof stuff has changed since then!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:10.62,0:23:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, punk!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.82,0:23:13.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're lucky I'm tied up!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.76,0:23:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon man, that\Nline's getting old.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.29,0:23:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, he's a good guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.66,0:23:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He saved the Merry\Nat least for a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.76,0:23:21.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.09,0:23:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Merry was...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.42,0:23:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.58,0:23:31.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon buddy, you can't get\Nall sad n' mopey on me now!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.88,0:23:33.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Blondie! Untie me!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.78,0:23:36.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pretty Please?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.23,0:23:37.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can spend the\Nrest of your life
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.30,0:23:39.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in that potato\Nsack for all I care!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.70,0:23:40.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.90,0:23:43.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said "pretty please" what\Nthe hell else do you want?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:43.64,0:23:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.84,0:23:46.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No more fighting, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.31,0:23:47.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.41,0:23:50.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we keep yelling, then the\Nmarine's are gonna come!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.44,0:23:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NYeah? Then shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.94,0:23:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NSay what?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.61,0:23:53.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NWhatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.26,0:23:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just untie me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.59,0:23:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NDon't order me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.43,0:23:57.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NStop fighting already!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.76,0:24:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain T-Bone?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.46,0:24:03.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.17,0:24:08.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A secret base?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.41,0:24:12.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been more than 8 years\Nsince anyone's set foot in here.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.38,0:24:16.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And nobody's touched the\Nsea train for more than 12.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:16.23,0:24:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NLet's go, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.68,0:24:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.75,0:24:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, the thing\Nmight not run anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.89,0:24:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.55,0:24:23.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better be kidding me!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.96,0:24:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now now, settle down, boys.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.48,0:24:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can run as fast as you like,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.02,0:24:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you're not getting\Ninside without the key!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.29,0:24:36.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.31,0:24:37.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that's weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.04,0:24:40.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's open-
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.85,0:24:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa-hoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.28,0:24:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.55,0:24:47.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check out the face!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:49.02,0:24:51.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NIt's so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.02,0:24:55.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NUnlike the Puffing Tom, this one here's a\Ncrazy train.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.99,0:24:58.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Its name is "Rocketman."
Dialogue: 50,0:24:58.42,0:25:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Comes with no guarantees, so board at your\Nown risk.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.22,0:25:03.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocketman!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.16,0:25:04.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds fast!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:04.40,0:25:06.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neat-o!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.40,0:25:09.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you have to add the face?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.07,0:25:12.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, it may be mean, but it won't\Nbite.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:15.18,0:25:17.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey look, it's Ice Pops!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.48,0:25:19.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ICEBURG]\NHello there, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.37,0:25:20.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you're okay after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.05,0:25:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems your friend's faith was\Nwell-founded.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.86,0:25:25.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I assume you brought them here,\NKokoro?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.61,0:25:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The question is, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.41,0:25:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've been through a\Nlot today, you need rest!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.25,0:25:33.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mmwell let's just say you
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.15,0:25:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I were thinking\Nthe same thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.92,0:25:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have a soft spot for idiots,\Ndon't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.90,0:25:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:45.15,0:25:46.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just finished servicing it.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.94,0:25:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water and coal have been loaded and the\Nsteam's building up now.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.95,0:25:53.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NThanks for getting it ready\Nfor us, we owe you one!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.23,0:25:58.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't celebrate\Nyet, if I were you.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.20,0:26:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You might not even survive the ride.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:00.45,0:26:03.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This was our failed prototype before we\Nmade the Puffing Tom.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.62,0:26:06.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how you tune it, you can't\Ncontrol its speed.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.46,0:26:10.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's a runaway train.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:10.26,0:26:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's fine!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.39,0:26:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can go as fast as it wants!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.20,0:26:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.52,0:26:20.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get on already!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.89,0:26:23.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're leaving as soon as Nami gets here,\NGranny!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.47,0:26:27.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah man.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.17,0:26:29.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NLuffy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.32,0:26:31.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've been kinda shaky on\Nyour feet since we found you.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.03,0:26:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHe probably just lost too much blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.29,0:26:35.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.39,0:26:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am feeling kinda dizzy.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.65,0:26:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I need some meat.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.65,0:26:42.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NHurry, this way!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.42,0:26:45.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STATION ATTENDANT]\NWait!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.12,0:26:46.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't see why you have to go
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.11,0:26:48.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all the way down here\Njust to eat your dinner!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.26,0:26:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:49.11,0:26:50.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're hungry, eat now!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.48,0:26:52.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYou think all that food is for me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.20,0:26:53.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.30,0:26:54.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry I took so long!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.91,0:26:55.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.78,0:26:57.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, save the\Nsmall talk for later!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.91,0:27:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get on board so we can go!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.32,0:27:01.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.93,0:27:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So there's another\Nsea train huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.76,0:27:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was hiding here all\Nthis time and we never knew!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.46,0:27:08.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STATION ATTENDANT]\NThis is a real surprise!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.79,0:27:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one who\Ntold us we have to hurry.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.66,0:27:12.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you the\Nlast one to get here!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:13.11,0:27:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what's with that big bag?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.61,0:27:16.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I brought you food and drinks.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.41,0:27:18.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I just yelled at you.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.58,0:27:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NHe's ready to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:21.13,0:27:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ICEBURG]\NYou'll shoot out of the canal into the\Nocean.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:23.47,0:27:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you can latch onto\Nthe railway after that,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.15,0:27:26.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it should be a good start.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:26.71,0:27:28.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry a bit!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.37,0:27:31.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like to drink,\Nbut I take my job seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.34,0:27:32.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just stay here
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.28,0:27:34.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and give that body\Nof yours a good rest!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.34,0:27:35.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds fine to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.38,0:27:37.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And while I'm taking\Ncare of these pirate folk,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.48,0:27:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope you don't mind watching\NGonbe and Chimney for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.10,0:27:46.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NStraw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.24,0:27:50.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWho's there?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.52,0:27:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Franky Family!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.11,0:27:58.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're kind of busy right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.21,0:28:00.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please! Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.16,0:28:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys gotta take us with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.55,0:28:04.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The people from Galley-La said
Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.25,0:28:08.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you were gonna take a\Nsea train to Enies Lobby!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.10,0:28:10.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those government bastards took Franky!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.20,0:28:12.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They took our bro away from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.95,0:28:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We wanna go,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.92,0:28:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we can't get through\NAqua Laguna alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:16.96,0:28:19.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure you wanna pick a fight on their\Nturf?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.56,0:28:21.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll fight anyone, anywhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.51,0:28:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NWe gotta get our bro back!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.67,0:28:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.73,0:28:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to us as long as\Nwe can save him!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.03,0:28:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIWI]\NWe're begging you!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.74,0:28:30.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please help us, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.74,0:28:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll do anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.20,0:28:36.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAMILY MAN]\NIf we don't hurry, bro is done for!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.04,0:28:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.98,0:28:43.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You steal our money, beat up our\Nfriend, then ask us for help?!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:47.89,0:28:50.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.59,0:28:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if it's wrong,\NI'm still begging you.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:53.91,0:28:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give up my pride if I can save him!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.42,0:29:12.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.59,0:29:13.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.42,0:29:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:20.39,0:29:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.45,0:29:24.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:25.49,0:29:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZAMBAI]\NThank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:27.97,0:29:29.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.46,0:29:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:32.63,0:29:36.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah we don't have to\Nget on the train, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.66,0:29:37.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll just hop on our king bulls
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.74,0:29:40.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and head out to sea the\Nsame time the train takes off.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.94,0:29:43.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All you gotta do is let the\Nbulls catch a ride on your tail.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.22,0:29:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're king bulls?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:45.88,0:29:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're off!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.45,0:29:48.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.01,0:29:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See ya, soon!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.77,0:29:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:51.37,0:29:53.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[FAMILY MEN]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.43,0:30:02.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's show those bastards
Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.44,0:30:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what we're made\Nof and save our bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:05.18,0:30:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're comin', bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.58,0:30:16.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.04,0:30:18.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.74,0:30:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now let's take off!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.47,0:31:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right boys and girls.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:00.94,0:31:03.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight,\Nso you don't fall off!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:15.72,0:31:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KOKORO]\NNow Departing Water\NSeven for Enies Lobby!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.68,0:31:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here comes Rocketman!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:25.65,0:31:26.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.02,0:31:28.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Full speed!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:32.25,0:31:33.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:33.56,0:31:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll get it all back!
